# BrainRace frontend configuration
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_BASE_URL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The base URL of the backend API the frontend talks to. Every request is
# built as `${VITE_API_BASE_URL}/api/...`.
#
# Production: leave it UNSET. Deployment is a single Render web service
# (see render.yaml) where the Express backend serves the built SPA from the
# same origin, so an unset/blank value resolves to a RELATIVE base and every
# request becomes `/api/...` against the page's own origin. There is no
# hardcoded backend host to keep in sync.
#
# Local development MUST set it to the local backend, otherwise the Vite dev
# server (http://localhost:5173) calls its own origin and hits Vite's 404
# instead of the backend on http://localhost:5000. Symptoms of that mistake:
# "this server has no ADMIN_USERNAME / ADMIN_PASSWORD configured", "OAuth is
# not configured", "email delivery is not configured".
#
# Vite loads .env.local in every mode, including `npm run build`. Gitignored
# or not, a build run on THIS machine bakes this value into the dist/ bundle
# (verified: a local build shipped `http://localhost:5000` inside dist/assets).
# That is harmless while the bundle is served from localhost:5000 itself, but
# uploading a locally built dist/ to any other host breaks every API call.
# Production is safe because Render runs `npm run build` in an environment
# where .env.local does not exist, producing a relative `/api` base.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This is a PUBLIC frontend variable. Vite inlines VITE_* values into the
# JavaScript bundle that every visitor downloads, so they are visible to
# anyone. Never put secrets, API keys, tokens, or credentials here. Backend
# secrets belong in backend/.env, which is gitignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000
